      "id": "tw-old-apartment",
      "topic": "home",
      "title": {
        "text": "老公寓",
        "zh": "",
        "en": "The old apartment"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "s": [
            "我家住在一棟四十年的老公寓，一共五層樓，沒有電梯。",
            "我們住在五樓，每天上下樓梯就像做運動一樣。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "My family lives in a forty-year-old apartment block: five floors and no lift. We live on the fifth floor, so going up and down the stairs every day is like exercise."
        },
        {
          "s": [
            "雖然房子很舊，但是鄰居們都很熟。",
            "誰家出遠門，大家就幫忙收信、餵貓。",
            "過年的時候，樓下的伯伯還會送我們自己包的水餃。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "The building is old, but the neighbours all know each other well. When a family goes away, everyone helps collect the post and feed the cat. At New Year the old man downstairs even gives us dumplings he wrapped himself."
        },
        {
          "s": [
            "爸爸說以後想搬到有電梯的大樓，可是我有點捨不得這裡。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "Dad says he'd like to move to a building with a lift one day, but I'd be a bit sad to leave."
        }
      ],
