      "id": "tw-beef-noodles",
      "topic": "food",
      "title": {
        "text": "牛肉麵",
        "zh": "",
        "en": "Beef noodle soup"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "s": [
            "很多外國朋友來臺灣，第一個想吃的就是牛肉麵。",
            "牛肉麵有紅燒和清燉兩種，",
            "紅燒的味道比較重，清燉的比較清淡。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "When foreign friends come to Taiwan, the first thing many want to eat is beef noodle soup. It comes in two kinds, braised and clear-stewed: braised has a stronger flavour, clear-stewed is lighter."
        },
        {
          "s": [
            "我最喜歡學校後面那家老店的紅燒牛肉麵。",
            "湯是老闆每天早上花五個小時煮的，牛肉又大塊又軟。",
            "雖然一碗要一百八十塊，但是我覺得很值得。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "My favourite is the braised beef noodle soup at the old shop behind our school. The owner spends five hours every morning making the broth, and the beef comes in big, tender chunks. A bowl costs 180 dollars, but I think it's well worth it."
        }
