      "id": "tw-jiufen",
      "topic": "travel",
      "title": {
        "text": "九份老街",
        "zh": "",
        "en": "Jiufen Old Street"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "s": [
            "上個週末，我帶日本來的朋友去九份。",
            "我們從臺北坐公車去，大概一個小時就到了。",
            "九份在山上，老街兩邊有很多賣小吃和紀念品的商店。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "Last weekend I took a friend from Japan to Jiufen. We went by bus from Taipei and got there in about an hour. Jiufen is on a hillside, and the old street is lined with shops selling snacks and souvenirs."
        },
        {
          "s": [
            "朋友說這裡很像她看過的一部電影，一直拿手機拍照。",
            "我們在一家茶館喝茶，從窗戶就能看到遠遠的海。",
            "可惜下午開始起霧，我們只好早一點下山。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "My friend said it looked just like a film she'd seen, and kept taking photos on her phone. We had tea at a teahouse where you can see the sea in the distance from the window. Unfortunately fog came in during the afternoon, so we had to come down a bit early."
        }
