      "topic": "weather",
      "title": {
        "text": "颱風假",
        "zh": "",
        "en": "A typhoon day off"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "s": [
            "昨天晚上新聞說，颱風明天會經過臺灣北部。",
            "十點左右，市政府宣布明天不用上班上課。",
            "弟弟聽到以後高興得跳了起來。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "Last night the news said a typhoon would pass over northern Taiwan the next day. Around ten, the city government announced there would be no work or school. My little brother jumped for joy when he heard."
        },
        {
          "s": [
            "可是今天早上起來一看，外面只下了一點小雨，風也不大。",
            "很多人在網路上開玩笑，說這是「颱風假」最常見的樣子。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "But when we got up this morning, there was only light rain outside and not much wind. Lots of people joked online that this is what a \"typhoon day off\" usually looks like."
        },
        {
          "s": [
            "媽媽說，雖然沒什麼風雨，安全還是最重要的，",
            "所以我們一整天都待在家裡看電影。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "Mom said that even without much wind and rain, safety comes first, so we stayed home all day watching films."
        }
