      "topic": "shopping",
      "title": {
        "text": "週年慶",
        "zh": "",
        "en": "The anniversary sale"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "s": [
            "每年十月，臺北的百貨公司都會舉辦週年慶。",
            "這個時候很多東西都打七折，買滿三千塊還送禮券。",
            "所以百貨公司一開門，門口就排滿了人。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "Every October Taipei's department stores hold their anniversary sales. Lots of things are 30% off, and spend three thousand and you get a gift voucher. So the moment the stores open, there's a long line at the door."
        },
        {
          "s": [
            "今年我也跟姊姊去了，本來只想買一瓶洗面乳，",
            "最後卻提了三大袋回家。",
            "回家算一算，花的錢比上個月的薪水還多。",
            "我決定明年要先寫好購物清單再去。"
          ],
          "zh": "",
          "en": "This year I went with my older sister. I only meant to buy a bottle of face wash, but ended up carrying three big bags home. When I added it up at home, I'd spent more than last month's salary. I've decided next year I'll write a shopping list first."
        }
